# NOTE: the markers compose onto an acronym expansion and gettext has no gender facility, so
# "%s, effet marginal" carries the adjective on a CONSTANT noun -- the expansions above may
# then be of any gender. The one constraint left is "log du %s": it needs a masculine,
# consonant-initial expansion, and only the five "rapport ..." ones are ever logged (an
# additive measure has no ratio to take the log of, so tab_reg() refuses it).
